{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And he took all the fat that is on the entrails.</b> Now at first it is written \"that covers the entrails,\" and afterward the verse says, \"that covers the entrails and all the fat that is on the entrails.\" Know that the fat that covers is very much, while \"all the fat that is on the entrails\" is a little from here and from here. Also, that which covers is upon the entrails; therefore Scripture took a abbreviated path."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:02.893145839Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}